{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"automated","type":"text","text":"AUTOMATED ENUMERATION\nWinPEASx64, PrivescCheck, PowerUp veya Seatbelt calistir\nservicesinfo/filesinfo ve privilege bulgularini oku\nTool ciktisini kanit kabul etme: her bulguyu manuel dogrula\nSysteminfo patch level'i Watson/Sherlock ile cross-check et","x":-800,"y":-680,"width":520,"height":160},
		{"id":"sebackup","type":"text","text":"DIGER GUCLU TOKEN HAKKI\nSeBackup -> SAM/SYSTEM veya shadow/NTDS kopyalama akisi\nSeRestore -> servis binary'si veya protected dosya replace\nSeTakeOwnership -> ownership al, ACL/servis yonet\nSeDebug -> LSASS dump; SeLoadDriver -> driver yolu\nUygun hak yoksa service enumeration'a gec","x":-920,"y":800,"width":520,"height":200},
		{"id":"registry","type":"text","text":"REGISTRY / ALWAYSINSTALLELEVATED\nHKLM ve HKCU Installer\\AlwaysInstallElevated degerlerini sorgula\nHer iki anahtar 0x1 ise MSI elevated calisma kosulunu dogrula\nRegistry'de servis, autologon ve application config credential'larini da ara\nBulgu yoksa scheduled task dalina gec","x":1560,"y":-955,"width":600,"height":155},
		{"id":"persistencenote","type":"file","file":"Persistence/Windows Persistence.md","x":2560,"y":1190,"width":440,"height":250},
		{"id":"root","type":"text","text":"SYSTEM PROOF / RAPOR\nwhoami /all, hostname, systeminfo ve proof/flag kanitini kaydet\nHangi enumeration bulgusunun hangi exploiti gerekcelendirdigini yaz\nSYSTEM/admin sonrasi SAM, LSA, LSASS ve cached credential loot'unu degerlendir\nPersistence sadece istenirse: local admin veya uygun startup/servis mekanizmasi","x":3580,"y":425,"width":640,"height":155},
		{"id":"tasks","type":"text","text":"SCHEDULED TASKS / STARTUP\nschtasks /query /fo LIST /v\nSYSTEM/Admin context'te calisan task'in Action path'ini incele\nTarget script/binary writable mi? icacls ile dogrula\nEVET -> payload yerine koy, task'i trigger et veya bekle\nStartup klasoru ve startup registry girdilerini de kontrol et","x":3600,"y":-1440,"width":520,"height":200},
		{"id":"windowsnote","type":"file","file":"Privilege Escalation/Windows Privilege Escalation.md","x":-960,"y":-2280,"width":960,"height":1360},
		{"id":"priv","type":"text","text":"TOKEN PRIVILEGE KONTROLU\nwhoami /priv ve whoami /groups\nSeImpersonate veya SeAssignPrimaryToken -> PrintSpoofer/GodPotato/RoguePotato/JuicyPotatoNG\nSeBackup -> SAM/SYSTEM veya ACL bypass\nSeRestore/SeTakeOwnership -> protected file/service\nSeDebug -> LSASS; SeLoadDriver -> vulnerable driver","x":-920,"y":80,"width":440,"height":200},
		{"id":"impersonate","type":"text","text":"SeImpersonate VAR MI?\nEVET -> once PrintSpoofer, uygun degilse GodPotato/RoguePotato\nJuicy Potato icin token/CLSID ve build kosullarini dogrula\nImpersonation basarisizsa mevcut high-priv token icin Incognito kontrol et\nSYSTEM shell alirsan proof kaydet, credential loot'a don","x":120,"y":-410,"width":640,"height":140},
		{"id":"footholdnote","type":"file","file":"Initial Foothold/Windows Foothold.md","x":-2920,"y":-680,"width":880,"height":1080},
		{"id":"files","type":"text","text":"WEAK FILE / FOLDER PERMISSIONS\nProgram Files, service binary, script ve config dizinlerini icacls ile kontrol et\nWritable SYSTEM task/service dosyasi varsa ilgili karta don\nInstalled applications ve custom servislerin relative path / writable dependency riskini incele\nBulgu yoksa token ve kernel son kontrollerine gec","x":5840,"y":-80,"width":640,"height":210},
		{"id":"kernel","type":"text","text":"KERNEL / PATCH EXPLOIT - SON SECENEK\nsysteminfo ve wmic qfe ile kesin build/patch level al\nWatson/Sherlock onerilerini PoC kosullariyla cross-check et\nPrintNightmare, CVE-2021-1732, SMBGhost ve diger adaylari sadece uyumluysa dene\nNoisy/crash riski nedeniyle manual yollar bittikten sonra kullan","x":5210,"y":880,"width":680,"height":155},
		{"id":"network","type":"text","text":"LOCAL NETWORK / LATERAL SIGNALI\nnetstat -ano ile internal-only servisleri process ile eslestir\nBulunan credential ile SMB, WinRM, RDP, MSSQL ve runas dene\nInternal web/DB varsa SSH/chisel veya mevcut Windows pivot yolunu kullan\nYeni host/shell -> credential ve privesc dongusunu yeniden baslat","x":5540,"y":1440,"width":600,"height":167},
		{"id":"credsdecision","type":"text","text":"CREDENTIAL / HASH BULGUSU VAR MI?\nParola -> local user, Administrator, services ve lateral access'te reuse kontrolu\nSAM/SYSTEM -> secretsdump ile local hashleri cikar\nSeDebug veya local admin -> LSASS dump, Mimikatz/procdump + pypykatz\nNTLM hash -> crack veya pass-the-hash; yeni shell varsa loop'a don","x":3800,"y":2240,"width":640,"height":175},
		{"id":"creds","type":"text","text":"CREDENTIAL HUNTING\nUnattend.xml, Panther/Sysprep, web.config/IIS connection strings\nPowerShell history, .rdp/.vnc, PuTTY/WinSCP, cmdkey ve application config\nXAMPP, backup registry hive, SAM/SYSTEM, .kdbx ve kullanici dokumanlari\nBulunan credential'i runas, SMB, WinRM, RDP, MSSQL ve local accounts'ta dene","x":1240,"y":1607,"width":640,"height":155},
		{"id":"services","type":"text","text":"SERVICE MISCONFIGURATION\nwmic service get name,pathname,startmode ile servisleri listele\naccesschk ve PowerUp ile service ACL, binary ve directory izinlerini dogrula\nService SYSTEM olarak mi calisiyor ve restart edilebilir mi?\nUnquoted path -> writable parent'a uygun binary koy\nWritable binary veya weak service config -> binary degistir ya da binpath'i kontrol et","x":760,"y":590,"width":680,"height":170},
		{"id":"start","type":"text","text":"INITIAL ACCESS / LOW-PRIV SHELL\nShell'i stabilize et: PowerShell veya uygun reverse shell\nwhoami /all, hostname ve systeminfo\nOS, version, architecture, groups ve patch level kaydet\nnetstat -ano, process ve installed application envanteri cikar","x":-1680,"y":-270,"width":520,"height":140},
		{"id":"dll","type":"text","text":"DLL HIJACKING / PATH ABUSE\nSYSTEM process/service hangi DLL'i yukluyor?\nProcess modules ve accesschk ile writable install directory ara\nMissing DLL + writable path + privileged process kosullarini ucunu de dogrula\nMatching export'lu DLL'i yerlestir, process/service restart kosulunu kontrol et","x":4600,"y":-320,"width":610,"height":160}
	],
